## Interface: 16001
## Title: Ziri's Toolkit
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\ZirisToolkit\Media\MinimapIcon
## Notes: Small helpers in one addon: Loot Highlight, Fresh Ranks, cleanse buttons, thanking people who buff you, an undress button, a separate quiver window, boat times, a tidier friends list, zones in Looking For Group, an instance limit counter, rested XP per character, buff reminders, a flight timer, threat for tanks, a healer mana warning, a disconnect tracker, a photo mode with an AFK screen and a page for console settings.
